<title>AUSTRIA: NO AUSTRIAN GRAIN BIDS SEEN AT EU EXPORT TENDER.</title>
<headline>NO AUSTRIAN GRAIN BIDS SEEN AT EU EXPORT TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian traders placed no bids for the export of free market grain at the European Union export tender, an official at state grain intervention board AMA said from Vienna.</p>
<p>The EU cereals management committee will meet later on Thursday to discuss bids from the individual member states.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
